Relay
=====

Relay is Railyard's LLM gateway. It is a maintained fork of TensorZero.

This product includes software developed by the TensorZero project
(https://github.com/tensorzero/tensorzero), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The vendored baseline is TensorZero 2026.6.0. Upstream source
files keep their original copyright and license notices and their history.
The upstream repository was archived on 2026-06-12. Relay continues it
independently.

Relay is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by TensorZero or its
authors. "TensorZero" is used only to identify the upstream project this work
derives from.

Railyard-authored additions are also licensed under Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE):
  - crates/relay-* (contract, SDK, AITP-402, billing, catalog, cost feed,
    hedging, Postgres settlement storage)
  - clients/relay-* (Relay SDKs)
  - Relay-specific gateway modules, migrations, tools/ and docs/RELAY-*
  - Relay modifications to upstream files, recorded in the git history

Third-party dependencies carry their own licenses, as recorded in each
package manifest and lockfile.
